claim.claim-text:
a) a filter cartridge assembly (32) having first and second flow paths formed therein;
b) a first lumen (34) extending from the filter cartridge and communicating with the first flow path for communicating with the surgical cavity to maintain a stable pressure level and facilitate smoke evacuation therein;
c) a second lumen (36) extending from the filter cartridge and communicating with the second flow path to deliver insufflation gas to the surgical cavity (18) and to sense cavity pressure.
